# Sibling-repo pinning for cross-repo integration tests.
#
# Format: <repo-name> <git-ref> <branch-name>
#   - <git-ref>:    SHA or branch name to fetch + checkout in CI.
#   - <branch-name>: branch the ref lives on (used by the workflow's
#                    "is it main?" guard).
#
# Pinning ``codetracer`` and ``codetracer-trace-format`` to ``dev``
# matches codetracer-solana-recorder so this recorder picks up the
# latest db-backend + trace-format APIs the WDIO suite expects.
codetracer dev dev
codetracer-vscode-extension main main
codetracer-trace-format dev dev
codetracer-trace-format-nim main main
